This project (LZA: Pokemon Legends: Z-A on HarmonyOS) was made from a copy of NativeGames-harmonyos (Tears of the
Kingdom on HarmonyOS); the files it keeps from that project, changed or not (most of entry/ and of the build scripts in
native-harmonyos/), are under the same MIT terms, Copyright (c) 2026 NativeGames-harmonyos contributors.

Files under native-harmonyos/overlay/ that have a counterpart in totk-android (at the commit in
native-harmonyos/UPSTREAM_PIN) are modified versions of those files and keep that project's MIT notice
(native-harmonyos/overlay/LICENSE.totk-android); the code under overlay/third_party/d2r_gfx/ started in d2r-mobile,
whose MIT notice is overlay/third_party/d2r_gfx/LICENSE. The overlay files without a counterpart are this project's
own, except runtime/audio_out_ohos.c, which is adapted from MacNativeGames (its MIT notice is the same text as
totk-android's); some follow nxnative, and android/gfx/vk_profile_gen.inc is generated from the Khronos Vulkan
registry, as their first comments say.

Third-party code elsewhere (native-harmonyos/za/d2r, native-harmonyos/third_party/etcpak) keeps its own license.
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists all third-party code, here and taken at build time.
